    "The heartbeat is activated in the background, it will restart when the app is re-opened or prompted. If the status below is pulsing, that means its healthy." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The heartbeat is activated in the background, it will restart when the app is re-opened or prompted. If the status below is pulsing, that means its healthy."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monitor pracy aplikacji działa w tle. Zostanie uruchomiony ponownie po ponownym otwarciu lub wymuszeniu. Jeśli poniższy status pulsuje, wszystko działa poprawnie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only supported repositories are AltStore repositories." : {
